Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Decompose the project into milestones with dependencies, feedback points, and explicit evidence criteria. Allocate time and resources through exact services, identify critical bottlenecks, and preserve room for learner choice within the required structure.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
